#: ../../resources/settings.md:1
msgid "右侧设置栏"
msgstr "Settings sidebar"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:3
msgid ""
"从工具栏选择输入模式，点击文件夹图标打开来源。右侧分组可点击标题展开；用 **Expand all / Collapse all** "
"展开或收起全部。设置较多时可滚动右栏，或拖动与图像区之间的分隔条。下面的截图均为运行中的完整主窗口。"
msgstr ""
"Choose an input mode on the toolbar and click the folder icon to open a source. Click any sidebar"
" heading to expand it, or use **Expand all / Collapse all**. Scroll the sidebar to reach more "
"controls, or drag the divider to change its width. The screenshots show the full application "
"window."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:5
msgid ""
"先设置同一组相关参数，再按 **Ctrl+R** 一次应用布局、算法和缓存编辑。**Power mode** 切换运行预算；工具栏保存按钮使用点击时的导出设置。截图均已勾选 **Layout &"
" Display → Fit window to image** 和 **Title**，并启用 **Titles → Auto "
"title**；刷新后窗口会按画布调整。要跟做示例，先打开[使用指南](usage.md)中对应的输入目录。"
msgstr ""
"Edit related settings together, then press **Ctrl+R** to apply layout, algorithm, and cache "
"changes. **Power mode** changes the resource budget. The toolbar Save button uses the export "
"settings in effect when clicked. The screenshots use **Layout & Display → Fit window to image**, "
"**Title**, and **Titles → Auto title**. Refresh to fit the window to the canvas. To follow along,"
" open the matching input directory from the [browsing guide](usage.md)."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:7
msgid "Input & Playback｜来源顺序和播放节奏"
msgstr "Input & Playback — source order and timing"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:9
msgid "![双视频并排，右栏展开 Input & Playback](../media/input-window.png)"
msgstr "![Two videos side by side with Input & Playback expanded](../media/input-window.png)"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:9
msgid "双视频并排，右栏展开 Input & Playback"
msgstr "Two videos side by side with Input & Playback expanded"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "控件"
msgstr "Control"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "设置方法"
msgstr "How to use it"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "Video mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "打开视频前勾选，浏览图像前取消。再从工具栏选择输入模式并打开来源。"
msgstr ""
"Enable before opening videos. Clear before browsing images. Then choose an input mode and open "
"the source from the toolbar."

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "Interval (s)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "手动输入希望的最短翻页间隔，例如 `1.0` 表示至少停留一秒。供给不足时，实际间隔可以更长。"
msgstr ""
"Enter the shortest desired interval between pages. For example, `1.0` keeps each page visible for"
" at least one second. The interval can increase if the next page is not ready."

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "Skip frames"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "两个采样帧之间跳过的视频帧数。填 `0` 逐帧查看；填 `1` 每隔一帧取一帧。"
msgstr "Number of frames to skip between samples. Use `0` for every frame or `1` for every other frame."

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "Multiple frames per source"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "并行来源各自连续显示多项。要同时查看每路的三个位置，在 Layout & Display 将 **Per source** 设为 `1,3`。"
msgstr ""
"Show consecutive items from each parallel source. To see three positions per source, set **Per "
"source** to `1,3` in Layout & Display."

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "Play sources sequentially"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "按来源依次浏览，例如先看完视频 A 再进入 B。这两个复选框互斥；要让两路视频始终并排、每路一帧，两项都取消。"
msgstr ""
"Browse one source after another, for example all of video A followed by video B. The two source-"
"order checkboxes are mutually exclusive. Clear both to keep one frame from each video side by "
"side."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:19
msgid "Performance & Cache｜速度、内存和画质"
msgstr "Performance & Cache — speed, memory, and quality"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:21
msgid "![双视频的性能模式与缓存设置](../media/performance-window.png)"
msgstr "![Performance and cache settings for two videos](../media/performance-window.png)"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:21
msgid "双视频的性能模式与缓存设置"
msgstr "Performance and cache settings for two videos"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:23
msgid ""
"**Power mode** 提供 Eco、Balanced、Performance、Maximum 四档。先用 Balanced；在持续播放时悬停查看播放与供给 "
"FPS、CPU、内存和活动任务，再决定是否提高预算。"
msgstr ""
"**Power mode** offers Eco, Balanced, Performance, and Maximum. Start with Balanced. During "
"sustained playback, hover over the control to inspect playback FPS, supply FPS, CPU, memory, and "
"active tasks before increasing the budget."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:24
msgid ""
"**Cache frames** 是当前页附近优先准备的半径，**Cache multiplier** 扩展外层半径，两项均填至少为 1 的整数。例如 `2` 和 `3` 对应内层 2 页、外层"
" 6 页；靠近首尾时仅缓存有效页。"
msgstr ""
"**Cache frames** sets the priority radius around the current page. **Cache multiplier** extends "
"the outer radius. Both take integers of at least 1. Values of `2` and `3` give inner and outer "
"radii of 2 and 6 pages. At either end, only valid pages are cached."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:25
msgid ""
"**Cache format** 选 `jpg` 可减少磁盘占用，`png` 可避免缓存阶段的 JPG 损失，`auto` 按导出格式和比例选择。勾 **Use saved JPG "
"quality** 时沿用导出质量，取消后可单独调节 **Cache JPG quality**。"
msgstr ""
"For **Cache format**, use `jpg` to save disk space, `png` to avoid JPEG loss during caching, or "
"`auto` to choose according to export format and scale. Enable **Use saved JPG quality** to follow"
" export quality, or clear it to set **Cache JPG quality** separately."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:27
msgid "Layout & Display｜画布怎么排"
msgstr "Layout & Display — arrange the canvas"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:29
msgid "![Layout & Display 展示视频示例的行列、间距与显示比例](../media/layout-window.png)"
msgstr "![Video grid, spacing, and display scale in Layout & Display](../media/layout-window.png)"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:29
msgid "Layout & Display 展示视频示例的行列、间距与显示比例"
msgstr "Video grid, spacing, and display scale in Layout & Display"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:31
msgid ""
"**Rows, cols** 先填行、再填列；右侧 **Vertical** 改为按列填充。**Size mode** 可选 resize、crop、fill；**Zoom "
"interpolation** 控制放大区的插值方式。**Fit window to image** 在刷新时按画布调整窗口。"
msgstr ""
"Enter rows first and columns second in **Rows, cols**. Select **Vertical** to fill columns first."
" **Size mode** offers resize, crop, and fill. **Zoom interpolation** controls magnification. "
"**Fit window to image** fits the window to the canvas on refresh."

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "网格"
msgstr "Grid"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "管什么"
msgstr "What it controls"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "Algorithms"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "每种算法的整幅拼接图占一格"
msgstr "One stitched panel per algorithm"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "`2,1` 上下对照原图与一种算法"
msgstr "Use `2,1` to stack the original above one algorithm result."

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "Page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "页面主网格"
msgstr "Main page grid"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "`1,2` 左右对比；`-1,-1` 自动计算"
msgstr "Use `1,2` for side-by-side comparison or `-1,-1` for automatic layout."

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "Per source"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "每个来源的连续项"
msgstr "Consecutive items from each source"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "配合 **Multiple frames per source** 使用"
msgstr "Use with **Multiple frames per source**."

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "Image unit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "一项内部的显示单元"
msgstr "Display units within an item"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "演示取 `3,1`，为图像、放大区和标题留出位置"
msgstr "The example uses `3,1` to make room for the image, magnifier, and title."

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "Magnifiers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "多个框的放大图"
msgstr "Magnified views from multiple boxes"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "两个框可用 `1,2` 横排"
msgstr "Use `1,2` for two boxes side by side."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:41
msgid ""
"**Gaps (X,Y for each level)** 按上表顺序给五对水平、垂直间距。**Image / Magnifier / Title** "
"决定哪些内容出现；单张输入已包含多个小图时可用 **Split image into units**，共用标题时选 **Shared title**。"
msgstr ""
"**Gaps (X,Y for each level)** takes five horizontal/vertical pairs in the order shown above. "
"**Image / Magnifier / Title** control which elements appear. Use **Split image into units** when "
"an input already contains several subimages, and **Shared title** for a common title."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:43
msgid ""
"**Display scale / Zoom scale** 填水平、垂直比例；**Image size / Zoom size** 填宽、高像素。`-1,-1` "
"在尺寸框中表示自动。需要固定放大图尺寸时使用 **Keep zoom size**。导出比例在 Save Settings 单独设置。"
msgstr ""
"**Display scale / Zoom scale** take horizontal and vertical factors. **Image size / Zoom size** "
"take width and height in pixels, with `-1,-1` for automatic sizing. Enable **Keep zoom size** for"
" fixed magnifier dimensions. Set export scales separately in Save Settings."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:45
msgid "Custom Functions｜对比原图和算法"
msgstr "Custom Functions — compare originals and results"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:47
msgid "![选中 Image Darkening，保留原图面板](../media/custom-window.png)"
msgstr "![Image Darkening selected with the original panel visible](../media/custom-window.png)"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:47
msgid "选中 Image Darkening，保留原图面板"
msgstr "Image Darkening selected with the original panel visible"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:49
msgid ""
"在下拉框选 **Image Darkening**，勾 **Selected** 和 **Show original panel**，将 **Layout & Display → "
"Algorithms** 设为 `2,1` 后刷新。上排显示原图，下排显示同一输入变暗后的结果。要比较更多算法，改选 **All "
"algorithms**，并给网格留足位置；超出容量的算法不会进入这次处理。**Add function (Enter)** 输入名称后回车，**Remove** "
"移除选中的算法。编写算法见[开发指南](../dev/dev.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Choose **Image Darkening**, enable **Selected** and **Show original panel**, set **Layout & "
"Display → Algorithms** to `2,1`, and refresh. The original appears above the darkened result. For"
" more algorithms, select **All algorithms** and allow enough grid cells. Algorithms beyond the "
"grid capacity are skipped. Type a name in **Add function (Enter)** and press Enter to add it. "
"**Remove** removes the selected algorithm. See the [Developer guide](../dev/dev.md) to write one."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:51
msgid "Magnifier & Boxes｜框与放大区"
msgstr "Magnifier & Boxes — inspect a region"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:53
msgid "![同一位置在两个来源中的框和放大细节](../media/magnifier-window.png)"
msgstr "![Matching boxes and magnified details across two sources](../media/magnifier-window.png)"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:53
msgid "同一位置在两个来源中的框和放大细节"
msgstr "Matching boxes and magnified details across two sources"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:55
msgid ""
"显示放大区需要先勾选 **Layout & Display → Magnifier**。打开放大工具，在图像上拖出矩形。**Boxes on images** 和 **Boxes on "
"magnifiers** 分别控制两处框线。**Line widths** 填两处线宽；**Position** 选择放置位置，例如 **middle bottom** "
"为底部居中。**Magnifier fit** 可按等宽、等高或等宽高排列。要调整已有框，勾选 **Select individual box** 后单击该框，用方向键微调。"
msgstr ""
"Enable **Layout & Display → Magnifier**, activate the magnifier tool, and drag a rectangle on an "
"image. **Boxes on images** and **Boxes on magnifiers** control the outlines on each. **Line "
"widths** sets their widths. **Position** places the magnified view, for example **middle bottom**"
" centers it at the bottom. **Magnifier fit** can match widths, heights, or both. To adjust a box,"
" enable **Select individual box**, click the box, and use the arrow keys."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:57
msgid "Titles｜选择标题字段"
msgstr "Titles — choose title fields"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:59
msgid "![Titles 分组，Auto title 已勾选](../media/title-window.png)"
msgstr "![Titles with Auto title enabled](../media/title-window.png)"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:59
msgid "Titles 分组，Auto title 已勾选"
msgstr "Titles with Auto title enabled"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:61
msgid ""
"视频示例画布上显示 Cat 和 Sunset。先在 **Layout & Display** 勾 **Title** 才能看到标题。**Auto title** "
"根据输入来源生成标题。若要手动选择内容，取消它，再选择 **Parent**（父目录）、**Prefix / Name / Suffix**（文件名组成部分）或 "
"**EXIF**。**Below** 将标题放在图片下方，**Alignment** 控制对齐，**Font size / Font** 控制字号和字体。为单张图显示自定义文本时，填写 "
"**Rename** 旁的文本，右键目标图注入，再开启 **Rename**。修改字体颜色见 Colour & Transparency。"
msgstr ""
"The video example shows Cat and Sunset. Enable **Title** under **Layout & Display**. **Auto "
"title** builds a title from the source. Clear it to choose **Parent** (parent folder), **Prefix /"
" Name / Suffix** (filename components), or **EXIF**. **Below** places titles under images. "
"**Alignment**, **Font size**, and **Font** control typography. For a custom title on one image, "
"enter text beside **Rename**, inject it using the image’s context menu, and enable **Rename**. "
"Set the font colour under Colour & Transparency."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:63
msgid "Save Settings｜导出内容和质量"
msgstr "Save Settings — export content and quality"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:65
msgid "![Save Settings 展示输出路径、内容、格式、质量和比例](../media/save-window.png)"
msgstr "![Save Settings with folder, content, format, quality, and scale](../media/save-window.png)"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:65
msgid "Save Settings 展示输出路径、内容、格式、质量和比例"
msgstr "Save Settings with folder, content, format, quality, and scale"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:67
msgid ""
"在 **Output folder** 点击 **Browse…** 选目录。在 **Content** 选择 **Stitch**（拼接）、**Selected "
"images**（挑图）、**Magnifiers**（放大区域），或选包含多项的组合。"
msgstr ""
"Click **Browse…** under **Output folder** to choose a directory. Under **Content**, choose "
"**Stitch**, **Selected images**, **Magnifiers**, or a combination."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:68
msgid ""
"**Format** 选 jpg、png 或 pdf。对应设置为 **JPG quality**、**PNG compression**、**PDF compression**。PNG 的 "
"Fast、Balanced、Smaller file 调整编码速度与体积；PDF 的 Lossless 和 Compact (JPG) 决定图片嵌入方式。"
msgstr ""
"Choose jpg, png, or pdf under **Format**. Adjust **JPG quality**, **PNG compression**, or **PDF "
"compression** as applicable. PNG’s Fast, Balanced, and Smaller file settings trade encoding time "
"for size. PDF’s Lossless and Compact (JPG) settings control how images are embedded."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:69
msgid "**Output scale** 控制主图输出比例，**Zoom output scale** 控制放大图。填 `1,1` 保留已配置的尺寸。点击工具栏保存按钮导出当前结果。"
msgstr ""
"**Output scale** controls the main image and **Zoom output scale** controls magnifiers. Use `1,1`"
" to keep the configured dimensions. Click Save on the toolbar to export."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:70
msgid ""
"勾 **Save all pages** 后保存整批，按 **Esc** 暂停，再点保存继续。**Move files** "
"用于移动挑中的源图，视频模式禁用。组合输出没有放大框时会跳过放大项，仍会保存勾选的拼接或挑图结果。"
msgstr ""
"Enable **Save all pages** for a batch. Press **Esc** to pause and click Save again to resume. "
"**Move files** moves selected source images and is disabled for videos. If a combined export has "
"no magnifier boxes, it skips magnifiers and still saves the requested stitches or selections."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:72
msgid "Colour & Transparency｜颜色和透明度"
msgstr "Colour & Transparency — colours and opacity"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:74
msgid "![Colour & Transparency 分组，三种颜色分别可调](../media/colour-window.png)"
msgstr "![Three independent colour controls in Colour & Transparency](../media/colour-window.png)"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:74
msgid "Colour & Transparency 分组，三种颜色分别可调"
msgstr "Three independent colour controls in Colour & Transparency"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:76
msgid ""
"**Box** 设置框线颜色，**Gap** 设置画布间隙颜色，**Font** 设置标题颜色。希望自己指定框色时，先取消 **Automatic box "
"colour**。**Background opacity** 控制画布背景，**Image opacity** 控制图像内容；`0` 为透明，`255` "
"为完全不透明。需要透明背景时，保留图像不透明，降低背景不透明度，并使用支持透明通道的 PNG 导出。JPG 会把透明区域合成到 Gap 颜色上。"
msgstr ""
"**Box**, **Gap**, and **Font** set the colours of outlines, canvas gaps, and titles. Clear "
"**Automatic box colour** to choose your own. **Background opacity** and **Image opacity** range "
"from `0` (transparent) to `255` (opaque). For a transparent background, keep the image opaque, "
"lower background opacity, and export PNG. JPG flattens transparent areas onto the Gap colour."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:78
msgid "Configuration｜记住或恢复一套设置"
msgstr "Configuration — save and restore settings"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:80
msgid "![Configuration 分组的 Load、Save、Reset](../media/configuration-window.png)"
msgstr "![Load, Save, and Reset in Configuration](../media/configuration-window.png)"

#: ../../resources/settings.md:80
msgid "Configuration 分组的 Load、Save、Reset"
msgstr "Load, Save, and Reset in Configuration"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "操作"
msgstr "Action"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "何时用"
msgstr "When to use it"

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "Save"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "布局、缓存和导出参数调好后，手动保存一套可复用的设置，也会记录分组折叠状态与右栏宽度。"
msgstr ""
"Store a reusable snapshot of layout, cache, and export settings, including collapsed sections and"
" sidebar width."

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "Load"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "尝试其他参数后，找回手动保存的那套设置。"
msgstr "Restore your saved snapshot after trying other settings."

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "Reset"
msgstr ""

#: ../../resources/settings.md
msgid "恢复默认参数、分组折叠状态和自动栏宽。手动保存的快照仍可用 Load 取回。"
msgstr ""
"Restore default settings, section states, and automatic sidebar width. Load can still retrieve "
"your saved snapshot."

#: ../../resources/settings.md:88
msgid "正常关闭后再启动会恢复上次使用状态。这里的 **Save** 保存配置；工具栏上的磁盘图标导出图像。"
msgstr ""
"A normal restart restores the last session’s settings. **Save** here stores a configuration. The "
"disk icon on the toolbar exports images."

